<title>USA: Sioux City hogs $0.50-1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux City hogs $0.50-1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX CITY 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.50-1.00 lower compared to Thursday. Top $54.50 per cwt. -</p>
<p>USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3   220-270 lbs     54.00-54.50, volume 54.50</p>
<p>	   270-280 lbs     53.50-54.00</p>
<p>US 2-3   280-300 lbs     52.00-53.50</p>
<p>US 3-4   300-330 lbs     50.00-51.50</p>
<p>Sows:  all weights steady to 1.50 lower. Top $50.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3   300-450 lbs	45.00-46.00</p>
<p>	   450-500 lbs	46.50</p>
<p>	   500-550 lbs	48.00</p>
<p>	   550-700 lbs	49.00-50.00</p>
</text>
